box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">2024年11月7日，北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所股权高级合伙人、博望餐饮法务咨询团队合伙人、花椒学社劳动用工管理专家<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">谢长丽律师</strong>应花椒学社邀请，为三十余家餐饮人带来<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">《“人效”时代，餐饮企业劳动用工应对方案》</strong>专题分享。此次分享主要围绕劳动用工相关法律条例及案例分析展开。谢律师满满的实战经验得到了在座餐饮人的一致好评。</p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"></p><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 10px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; min-width: 10%; max-width: 100%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; align-self: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: flex; flex-flow: row; justify-content: center; margin: 0px 0% -4px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; align-self: flex-start; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 0px; border-radius: 55px 55px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(181, 71, 49) rgb(181, 71, 49) rgb(62, 62, 62); line-height: 0; padding: 4px 4px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: flex; flex-flow: row; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; align-self: flex-start; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 0px; border-radius: 55px 55px 0px 0px; border-color: rgb(181, 71, 49) rgb(181, 71, 49) rgb(62, 62, 62); line-height: 0; padding: 4px 4px 0px; box-sizing: border-